---
import ToolLayout from '../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---

<ToolLayout slug="removebg">
  <section slot="hero" class="tool-hero">
    <div class="tool-hero__copy">
      <h1>AI 一键抠图，<br>只留主体。</h1>
      <p class="tool-benefit">上传图片，AI 自动识别主体并生成透明背景 PNG。模型在你的浏览器里运行，图片<strong>不会上传到服务器</strong>。</p>
      <div class="dropzone" id="dropzone" role="button" tabindex="0">
        <span class="dropzone__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 16V4"/><path d="m7 9 5-5 5 5"/><path d="M5 15v4h14v-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="dropzone__main">
          <b>点击选择图片，或拖到这里</b>
          <span>JPG / PNG / WebP · 首次使用需加载约 90MB 模型，之后有浏览器缓存</span>
        </span>
        <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept="image/*">
      </div>
      <p class="tool-note">本地推理 · 首次约 90MB · 0 上传</p>
    </div>

    <div class="demo-stage stage-removebg">
      <span class="stage-note">示例 · 抠图前后</span>
      <div class="half"><img src="/assets/demo/removebg-before.jpg" alt="示例原图：暖色背景上的瓶子" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="half after"><img src="/assets/demo/removebg-after.png" alt="示例结果：透明背景的瓶子" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="stage-divider"></div>
      <span class="stage-tag">原图</span>
      <span class="stage-tag dark" style="left:auto;right:12px">透明 PNG</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-section hidden" id="workArea">
    <div class="work-head"><h2>抠图结果</h2><span>本地推理 · 0 上传</span></div>
<div class="compare">
        <div class="compare-box">
          <h3>原图</h3>
          <img id="previewOrig" src="/assets/demo/removebg-before.jpg" alt="原图">
          <div class="compare-meta" id="metaOrig"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-box is-alpha">
          <h3>抠图结果（透明背景）</h3>
          <img id="previewResult" src="/assets/demo/removebg-after.png" alt="抠图结果">
          <div class="compare-meta" id="metaResult"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:14px">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btnDownload">下载 PNG</button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btnAgain">换一张图片</button>
      </div>
  </section>

  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><span class="n">01</span><div><b>放入图片</b><p>点击或拖入一张照片，文件只在浏览器里读取。</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">02</span><div><b>本地识别</b><p>AI 模型在浏览器里运行；首次约 90MB，之后走缓存。</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">03</span><div><b>下载透明 PNG</b><p>结果另存为新图，原图不会被修改。</p></div></div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline src="/js/common.js"></script>
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/js/removebg.js"></script>
</ToolLayout>
